{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.slump.third",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "真乃 · 唱不出来的那天 · third",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.slump.third",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.slump.third",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "n01",
    "nodes": {
      "n01": {
        "id": "n01",
        "text": "第二天。练习室的窗帘拉开了，光落在地板中间。",
        "nextNodeId": "n02"
      },
      "n02": {
        "id": "n02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我准备好了。",
        "textVariants": [
          {
            "when": [
              {
                "kind": "varAtLeast",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "kind": "varAtMost",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 1
              }
            ],
            "text": "我数过了。第二段最后那句，一共 11 个字，我拆成了三段练。"
          },
          {
            "when": [
              {
                "kind": "varAtLeast",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 2
              },
              {
                "kind": "varAtMost",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 2
              }
            ],
            "text": "昨天什么都没想，睡了一整天。……好像有点用。"
          },
          {
            "when": [
              {
                "kind": "varAtLeast",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 3
              },
              {
                "kind": "varAtMost",
                "key": "mano.slumpApproach",
                "value": 3
              }
            ],
            "text": "我把那段重听了。听了七遍。……然后发现自己一直在抢拍。"
          }
        ],
        "nextNodeId": "n03"
      },
      "n03": {
        "id": "n03",
        "text": "她按下播放键。这一次，从头到尾没有停。",
        "nextNodeId": "n04"
      },
      "n04": {
        "id": "n04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……唱完了。",
        "nextNodeId": "n05"
      },
      "n05": {
        "id": "n05",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "制作人先生。昨天那些话，我想收回。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "不用收回，那也是你的一部分",
            "nextNodeId": "n06a",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 5
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "下次卡住的时候，也告诉我",
            "nextNodeId": "n06b",
            "effects": [
              {
                "kind": "attributeExp",
                "ref": "trust",
                "tier": 5
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "n06a": {
        "id": "n06a",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "……嗯。那我要连着好的部分一起收下。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n06b": {
        "id": "n06b",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好。下次……我会在更早的时候说。",
        "nextNodeId": "n07"
      },
      "n07": {
        "id": "n07",
        "text": "她重新戴上耳机。窗外的鸽子落在窗台上，这次没有飞走。"
      }
    }
  },
